{"speciesId":290,"names":{"fr":"Ningale","es":"Nincada","en":"Nincada","ja":"ツチニン"},"descriptions":[{"language":"en","version":"ruby","text":"NINCADA lives underground for many years in complete darkness. This POKéMON absorbs nutrients from the roots of trees. It stays motionless as it waits for evolution."},{"language":"en","version":"sapphire","text":"NINCADA lives underground. It uses its sharp claws to carve the roots of trees and absorb moisture and nutrients. This POKéMON can’t withstand bright sunlight so avoids it."},{"language":"en","version":"emerald","text":"It makes its nest at the roots of a mighty tree. Using its whiskerlike antennae, it probes its surroundings in the pitch-black darkness of soil."},{"language":"en","version":"firered","text":"Because it lived almost entirely underground, it is nearly blind. It uses its antennae instead."},{"language":"en","version":"leafgreen","text":"Because it lived almost entirely underground, it is nearly blind. It uses its antennae instead."},{"language":"en","version":"diamond","text":"It grows underground, sensing its surroundings using antennae instead of its virtually blind eyes."},{"language":"en","version":"pearl","text":"It grows underground, sensing its surroundings using antennae instead of its virtually blind eyes."},{"language":"en","version":"platinum","text":"It grows underground, sensing its surroundings using antennae instead of its virtually blind eyes."},{"language":"en","version":"heartgold","text":"It can sometimes live underground for more than 10 years. It absorbs nutrients from the roots of trees."},{"language":"en","version":"soulsilver","text":"It can sometimes live underground for more than 10 years. It absorbs nutrients from the roots of trees."},{"language":"fr","version":"black","text":"Il grandit sous terre et se repère grâce à ses antennes car ses yeux sont quasiment aveugles."},{"language":"en","version":"black","text":"It grows underground, sensing its surroundings using antennae instead of its virtually blind eyes."},{"language":"fr","version":"white","text":"Il grandit sous terre et se repère grâce à ses antennes car ses yeux sont quasiment aveugles."},{"language":"en","version":"white","text":"It grows underground, sensing its surroundings using antennae instead of its virtually blind eyes."},{"language":"en","version":"black-2","text":"It grows underground, sensing its surroundings using antennae instead of its virtually blind eyes."},{"language":"en","version":"white-2","text":"It grows underground, sensing its surroundings using antennae instead of its virtually blind eyes."},{"language":"fr","version":"x","text":"Comme il vit presque toujours sous terre, sa vue est très peu développée et il est presque aveugle. Il utilise ses antennes pour se repérer."},{"language":"es","version":"x","text":"Como se ha pasado casi toda la vida viviendo bajo tierra, no ve bien. Las antenas que tiene le ayudan a orientarse."},{"language":"en","version":"x","text":"Because it lived almost entirely underground, it is nearly blind. It uses its antennae instead."},{"language":"ja","version":"x","text":"長い あいだ 地中で 暮らして いたため 目は ほとんど 見えない。 触覚で 様子を 探る。"},{"language":"fr","version":"y","text":"Il peut passer jusqu’à dix ans sous terre. Les racines des arbres constituent son régime alimentaire."},{"language":"es","version":"y","text":"Algunos pasan más de diez años bajo tierra. Absorbe nutrientes de las raíces de los árboles."},{"language":"en","version":"y","text":"It can sometimes live underground for more than 10 years. It absorbs nutrients from the roots of trees."},{"language":"ja","version":"y","text":"１０年以上 土の 中で 暮らす ことも ある。樹木の 根っこから 栄養を 吸い取る。"},{"language":"fr","version":"omega-ruby","text":"Ningale vit depuis des années sous terre, dans l’obscurité la plus totale. Ce Pokémon absorbe les nutriments des racines des arbres. Il reste immobile, attendant patiemment son évolution."},{"language":"es","version":"omega-ruby","text":"Nincada vive bajo tierra en la más absoluta oscuridad durante años. Este Pokémon absorbe nutrientes de las raíces de los árboles y permanece inmóvil a la espera de su evolución."},{"language":"en","version":"omega-ruby","text":"Nincada lives underground for many years in complete darkness. This Pokémon absorbs nutrients from the roots of trees. It stays motionless as it waits for evolution."},{"language":"ja","version":"omega-ruby","text":"何年も 真っ暗な 土の 中で 暮らす。 木の 根っこから 栄養を 吸収して じっと 動かず 進化の ときを 待っている。"},{"language":"fr","version":"alpha-sapphire","text":"Ningale vit sous terre. Il utilise ses griffes acérées pour creuser les racines des arbres et en absorber l’humidité et les nutriments. Ce Pokémon ne supporte pas la lumière du soleil."},{"language":"es","version":"alpha-sapphire","text":"Nincada vive bajo tierra y usa las garras afiladas que tiene para escarbar y buscar raíces de árboles y absorber humedad y nutrientes. Este Pokémon huye de la luz del sol porque le hace daño."},{"language":"en","version":"alpha-sapphire","text":"Nincada lives underground. It uses its sharp claws to carve the roots of trees and absorb moisture and nutrients. This Pokémon can’t withstand bright sunlight so avoids it."},{"language":"ja","version":"alpha-sapphire","text":"鋭い ツメで 樹木の 根っこを 削り 水分や 栄養を 吸収する。 太陽の 光は まぶしいので 苦手。"},{"language":"fr","version":"sword","text":"Parce qu’il a longtemps vécu sous terre, il est presque aveugle et utilise ses antennes pour se repérer."},{"language":"es","version":"sword","text":"Vivir bajo tierra durante tanto tiempo lo ha dejado prácticamente ciego. Las antenas que tiene le ayudan a orientarse."},{"language":"en","version":"sword","text":"Because it lived almost entirely underground, it is nearly blind. It uses its antennae instead."},{"language":"ja","version":"sword","text":"長い あいだ 地中で 暮らして いたため 目は ほとんど 見えない。 触角で 様子を 探る。"},{"language":"fr","version":"shield","text":"Il peut passer plus de dix ans sous terre. Les racines des arbres constituent son régime alimentaire."},{"language":